* wizslow - module and FPGA UART to 115200 baud. Needs: wizi, no connections active. Sets the module
* (AT+UART_CUR) first, then the driver: bau=A on all five devices = WizFi rate code 10
* (WizFi.Baud115200, 2026-10-06 cores; the core runs the W600's actual rate). The setting is lost when
* the module resets.
echo ATE1>/wz
modem /wz
echo AT+UART_CUR=115200,8,1,0,0>/wz
modem /wz
xmode /wz bau=A
xmode /wz0 bau=A
xmode /wz1 bau=A
xmode /wz2 bau=A
xmode /wz3 bau=A
echo AT>/wz
modem /wz
